  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Hei Lou Lan is blocked six times at the 54th round of Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, he kicks tribesman Hei Qi Sheng to the ground and beats him until he coughs blood. Hei Qi Sheng sprawls and begs for death for his inability; elders who pleaded for him earlier are still bedridden from Hei Lou Lan’s kicks. Hei Lou Lan kicks him again so Wolf King will not see him lying there, then orders him out to nurse his injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        556
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "First elder Hei Pei tells Hei Lou Lan the round needs master level enslavement attainment and that Hei Qi Sheng is not a master, so they need Wolf King Chang Shan Yin.",
      "chapters": [
        556
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "round-fifty-four-and-wolf-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_first_supreme_elder",
        "char_hei_pei",
        "char_chang_shan_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later works the round, observers note that Hei Qi Sheng would need to enslave fish one by one with care, and call him like a baby next to Chang Shan Yin.",
      "chapters": [
        557
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "round-fifty-four-and-wolf-king",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As elder Hei Qi Sheng he argues against opening True Yang Building to outsiders after Hei tribe won the Imperial Court contest.",
      "chapters": [
        562
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elder-voice-and-flying-bear-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against the flying bear phantom he is named with Tang Miao Ming among the enslavement Gu Masters who watch Fang Yuan work, then replaces the wolves: he controls eagle groups while she runs foxes. Wind tigers and cloud dragons wreck much of his eagle group, and he ends with a bleeding nose and shame for letting the lords down.",
      "chapters": [
        582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "elder-voice-and-flying-bear-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
